# LoanMe

## Problem

People looking for loans often have to visit
many different lenders individually.

## Goal

Create a marketplace where users can discover,
compare, and evaluate loan products in one place.

## MVP Features

- Browse loans
- Search loans
- Filter loans
- View loan details
- Compare loans
- Save loans

## Planned Tech Stack

Frontend: React
Backend: Node.js + Express
Database: PostgreSQL

